AlphaBeta(node, depth, α, β, maximizingPlayer)

If node is terminal OR depth == 0
    Return evaluation(node)

If maximizingPlayer

    value = -∞

    For each child

        value = max(value,
                    AlphaBeta(child, depth-1, α, β, False))

        α = max(α, value)

        If α ≥ β
            Break   // Beta Cutoff

    Return value

Else

    value = +∞

    For each child

        value = min(value,
                    AlphaBeta(child, depth-1, α, β, True))

        β = min(β, value)

        If α ≥ β
            Break   // Alpha Cutoff

    Return value